WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Open the sidebar

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.800
Touch and hold a project

3
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.200
Move to Trash keeps a project for 30 days

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.800
Archive Project… keeps it for good

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.300
Confirm — nothing is deleted

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.800
Archived — everything is still here

7
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.300
Restore Project brings it back

8
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.800
Close the list

9
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:43.300
Back in the sidebar, as it was
